
/*!
	add counter representing how many clients use an extension.

	unloading should happen per client close. the client loads, the counter goes up, the counter goes up on client close. if 0, unload.
*/

/*!
	implement a single malloc segment to "malloc" on.
*/

/*!
	lower the registration loop down the totem pole of importance: tell the reply loop to sign up the client itself, as if it was a request.

	something like that might also be wrong in other ways the threads communicate. fix that too.
*/

/*!
	allocate about 16kib for a max of 256 requests.

	do the same for replies and events. do the math.
*/



























